<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8478" root="حفر" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفَرٌ</span></b>  <i>A well that is widened</i> (K, TA) <i>beyond.
measure;</i> (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفْرٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِيرٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفيرَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  The
<i>earth that is taken forth from a hollow, cavity,
pit, or the like, that is dug in the ground;</i> (S,
K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَدَمٌ</span>: (S:) [see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِيرَةٌ</span>:] or <i>what
is dug,</i> or <i>excavated;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَدٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَطٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَضٌ</span> in the senses of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْدُودٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخْبُوطٌ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْفُوضٌ</span>: (Msb:) or <i>a place that is dug,</i> (Az,
S, Msb,) <i>like a moat or well;</i> (Az, Msb;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفْرٌ</span></b> : (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحْفَارٌ</span>, (Msb, K,) and pl.
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَحَافِيرُ</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفِيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  And
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَفْرٌ</span>.

